SOURCE_FILE
  COMMENT "//! The `parse` service: free functions that drive an implementation of the contract. They read a file's"
  WHITESPACE "\n"
  COMMENT "//! rows with the readers the implementation answers, and say what it answers for a relation. The"
  WHITESPACE "\n"
  COMMENT "//! implementation builds a tree; the engine reads it, once, for every relation wanted, and gives each"
  WHITESPACE "\n"
  COMMENT "//! reader the rows of its own relation to write and no other."
  WHITESPACE "\n\n"
